//! §11 G-34) and are NOT this file's `merge` / `lerp`: `actions_graphic.rs`
//! evaluates them by the props' kinds, into [`Evaluated::graphic`]. The
//! model's colours, known by key, are blended in OKLab after the `lerp` by
